if there are too many codes in the system.

Therefore, we suggest that BOMBB use DCS(CNTR SERVICE CHRG AT DEST.) i/o new code DPS.

Please advise us.

Thank you.



B.rgds

CCE / Asia&Europe Customer Team
Luth (Kyungwon) CHOI

